title: "Core Network: Architecture and Signaling Procedures"
abstract: >-
  A reference book on the architecture of the GPRS core network and the
  Evolved Packet Core (EPC), and on the signaling procedures between their
  network elements, with call flows and 3GPP TS clause citations.
